label culinarystart:
    play music "audio/campfire.mp3"
    $ position = "backyard"
    call sceneimg

    player "I had just moved to the bustling city, ready to begin a fresh chapter in my life as an aspiring cook. As I stood on the doorstep of my new home, a quaint apartment nestled within a neighborhood adorned with fences and streetlights, I couldn't help but feel a sense of excitement and curiosity."

    player "The neighborhood had its own unique charm, with well-kept houses and a myriad of twinkling lights that cast a warm, inviting glow. The hum of the city's nightlife surrounded me, promising adventures yet to be had."

    player "My apartment, though cozy, had a tiny kitchen that held immense potential. It was a blank canvas, awaiting my culinary creations. The living room had a large window that let in plenty of natural light, perfect for growing herbs and experimenting with new recipes."

    player "Just a short walk from my doorstep, I discovered a local farmers' market where fresh, vibrant ingredients were in abundance. It was clear that this neighborhood valued quality food, and I couldn't wait to explore the market's offerings."

    player "As I unpacked my belongings, I couldn't help but feel a sense of anticipation. This city held the promise of culinary adventures, new friendships, and a journey into the world of flavors. With my pots and pans at the ready, I was prepared to turn this cozy apartment into the heart of my culinary dreams."
    show screen callmap
    jump culinarychoices
